# Keep host-generated build artifacts out of the Docker build context. Without this, `COPY
# src/backend/ .` / `COPY src/frontend/ .` in src/backend/Dockerfile would ship the host's own
# bin/obj (which can embed host-specific, e.g. Windows, NuGet paths into project.assets.json) or
# node_modules into the image, breaking the container's own restore/install - discovered while
# validating this Dockerfile (F-003).

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/
.git/
.env
*.md
